      "writtenOn": "2022-07-15T15:54:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm but this is for single channel - single bis there should be only single stream.",
      "revId": "1a84af8dfd3ffdcfefd7d6b8285ce5db5c1a4062",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "77fa51bd_5baded60",
        "filename": "system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster_types.cc",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 295,
      "author": {
        "id": 1730162
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-15T17:06:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we only have one BIS, it would be 2 audio channel per BIS, 1 Audio stream. It\u0027s the audio configuration 14 in BAP. \n\nThe concept num_channels seems not meet the meaning, we put it in the level 2 as 1 BIS only. It more like be the count of BIS.",
      "parentUuid": "55608234_1e823d74",
      "revId": "1a84af8dfd3ffdcfefd7d6b8285ce5db5c1a4062",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a0a20900_6d48b03d",
        "filename": "system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster_types.cc",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 295,
      "author": {
        "id": 1532219
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T08:21:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s most likely not enough to support configuration 14 from BAP. It seems to me that we would also have to add support for multiple frame blocks per SDU, which is multiplexing both encoded LC3 channels into a single output data stream going to this single BIS. ...and since this was a `mono` scenario, we now most likely ask the audio framework (LeAudioBroadcastClientAudioSource::setCurrentCodecConfig()) for a single channel downmixed mono track. Which should not be the case in configuration 14.\n\nDo we really want to support this configuration now? It does not seem to be mandatory for BAP.",
      "parentUuid": "77fa51bd_5baded60",
      "revId": "1a84af8dfd3ffdcfefd7d6b8285ce5db5c1a4062",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "49dbf21e_9f9292c3",
        "filename": "system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster_types.cc",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 295,
      "author": {
        "id": 1927775
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T08:44:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok... got it but I think this is not enough to change only location 😊\nThere should be also introduced a mechanism as is for unicast for interleaving encoded frames and a little bit more.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/le_audio/client.cc;drc\u003d07327df79c068cbe5bfb631a1e16d391e54ff5fe;l\u003d2121",
      "parentUuid": "77fa51bd_5baded60",
      "revId": "1a84af8dfd3ffdcfefd7d6b8285ce5db5c1a4062",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "319bb5c0_9e64ac0c",
        "filename": "system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster_types.cc",
